@dllehr-amd @Fangzhou-Ai  @ChuanLi1101 @shen-shanshan @chunfangamd @sunway513

Currently the ROCm DI CI is blocked due to ABI mismatch with IONIC drivers on the DI CI cluster. This PR allows to unblock by re-installing the required ionic rdma userspace to match the cluster. 
Can we please review this and prioritize this PR to unblock AMD DI CI.

